Description: Provides functions for fitting and analyzing linear
    regression models using ordinary least squares and QR decomposition,
    and for fitting ridge regression models with a penalty parameter
    lambda. Includes print, summary, coefficient, residual, prediction
    and diagnostic plot methods, as well as a function for visualizing
    average flight delays at New York City airports.
